                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The awkwardly titled ‘A Wonder’, is a stealth puzzle game developed by a group of students over 15 weeks. A Wonder isn’t very innovative but does feature a fairly interesting torchlight puzzle mechanic that only proved frustrating due to my ineptitude. There were some noticeable problems with performance in certain areas and the absence of key rebinding was frustrating. It’s also pretty poor visually both in fidelity and style even when compared to other student projects.",
